{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17209190","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17209190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1720919001:1":{"text":"这位先生，日安。我是《赛凡纳晨报》的实习记者赫蒂奇，正在进行一项社会调查。","source_cn":"这位先生，日安。我是《赛凡纳晨报》的实习记者赫蒂奇，正...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x191F5A562A6A8796","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1720919002:1":{"text":"啊？记者？社会调查？","source_cn":"啊？记者？社会调查？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5C8E5CCB3E88A1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720919003:1":{"text":"是的！请问您最近在德米特子爵府邸周围，有没有见过什么可疑的人？","source_cn":"是的！请问您最近在德米特子爵府邸周围，有没有见过什么可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC14AE8DC76CC4C43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720919004:1":{"text":"可疑的人？","source_cn":"可疑的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45C5F3FC84F58B77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720919005:1":{"text":"比如，有没有那种鬼鬼祟祟、四处探听消息的神秘人？或者，突然冒出来自称是远方亲戚的陌生人？再或者，有没有那种乔装打扮、行为举止非常可疑的人士？","source_cn":"比如，有没有那种鬼鬼祟祟、四处探听消息的神秘人？或者，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2CDE3247CAF7BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docu